{"server":"tw","storyId":"act21side_level_act21side_08_beg","groupId":"act21side","stageId":"act21side_08","title":"危如累卵","storyCode":"IS-8","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act21side/level_act21side_08_beg.txt","sourceHash":"c54bf3d2a571eca1f308eff9e70cda1863b41d15138e9507bb6480c0f665c1d3","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"這場演出徹底落幕，有些人結盟，有些人分裂。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g10_smallrestaurant"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"店員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您點的披薩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個位置有人坐嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就不客氣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說了，有人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您還是回去繼續完成您的家族任務，不要來管我這樣的普通人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉維妮婭姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不怪你，萊昂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不怪貝納爾多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我有一個責怪的對象，那只能是我自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是生在這個國家卻依然心存幻想的我不對，我沒有理由去責備你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想在這個時候勸你理智一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，一切的安慰都沒有意義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使我自認與你同樣是受害者，但你把我當做加害者也是理所當然的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只能告訴你......我還沒有放棄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最近城裡事情很多，自己注意安全，遇到麻煩可以給我打電話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"盧比奧部長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盧比奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"法官小姐，現在有空嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g2_srcalley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"街上的人感覺表情都好緊張。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟昨天發生了那樣的事情......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們真的要去見那個總監嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，無論如何，有些話還是要和總監說清楚的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，可頌你繼續去做你的事情吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有我在，放心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這樣的話，今天我就來保護可頌吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，那就拜託你啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"出什麼事的話記得立刻聯絡我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"好~"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可頌，你在想德克薩斯的事，對吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......很明顯嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很明顯哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為我也在想一樣的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我當然知道空的想法，如果德克薩斯想要留下來，她會尊重德克薩斯的意見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還想讓姐姐也見一見我的幾個夥伴呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少，如果有辦法能讓德克薩斯安全離開敘拉古，你想找到這種方法，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......瞞不過你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"肯定也沒有瞞過她們兩個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像我們會尊重空的想法一樣，她們也能理解我們的想法的啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，這裡畢竟是敘拉古......而且德克薩斯是和這個國家最厲害的傢伙們有牽扯，我也不知道該怎麼辦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？我還以為，你已經想到了呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......說到這個國家的大人物，我們昨天不是也遇到過一個了嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g7_reception"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請進。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"空小姐，切利尼娜小姐，歡迎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼要把空她們牽扯進來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"空小姐的履歷會來到我手上確實是一個意外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，這也可以稱得上是某種必然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟，白日劇團在敘拉古也是小有名氣的劇團。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只不過，擔任劇團總監的是貝洛內家族的領袖，終究算是一個秘密。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"貝洛內在這座城裡的諸多事務，畢竟是交給了我的兒子，我並不打算干涉他的行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"切利尼娜小姐，空小姐，我擔任這個劇團的總監有六年了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望你們至少相信，我對於藝術的追求與喜愛，與我的身份無關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果可能，我也希望能讓空小姐在舞台上發光發熱，然後讓兩位完成感人的重逢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，她被牽扯進來了，你也不在乎，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"少故作姿態了，貝納爾多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論你說得再怎麼漂亮，對你來說，遇到空或許確實是偶然，但你真的關心她的安危？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別開玩笑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"切利尼娜小姐，很好，這是你來到敘拉古以來，我第一次見到你憤怒的樣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"......總監，我想知道一件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請講。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"我和您之間的約定，還生效嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是指——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"即使我找到了德克薩斯，我也會在這個劇團繼續演藝工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還以為，你是來與我中止合約的，空小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"......對於家族紛爭來說，我的力量微不足道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"德克薩斯如果在混亂的局勢中還要保護我們，那太困難了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"而我相信您至少是一個遵守約定的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，開門見山地說，我願意留在這裡，成為那個人質。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的勇氣總是令我動容，空小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，你們大可不必緊張。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"空小姐，我叫你來不是為了責備你的，事實上，劇院這一次本來就是和羅塞蒂打一聲招呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的成果已經超出了我的想像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我想告訴你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你我之間的約定，到此為止。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你自由了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g7_reception"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從現在開始，切利尼娜不再受到貝洛內的保護。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個籌碼不知道能不能讓你滿意，瓦拉赫小友？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"滿意？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你難道以為我會忘了是誰把她弄回來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只想知道，從一開始，你就是這麼打算的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你應該感謝我的兒子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是他告訴我，你是一個可以合作的對象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊昂大少爺，哈，原來如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一直以來，我都很看好羅塞蒂家族發展的勢頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"切利尼娜只是為我們今天的合作搭建了一個平台罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是說，就算萊昂圖索沒有找我，你也會找我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是父子齊心，感人肺腑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，真希望我兒子也能學一學你這份銳氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽著，貝納爾多，其他人或許會吃你這一套。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我不會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，瓦拉赫，我做這些，不過是想要讓你明白，你的阻礙究竟是誰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？我的阻礙難道不正坐在我的面前嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想讓我背叛首領，做夢吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"背叛？你錯了，這是提醒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你心裡難道不是最清楚的嗎，瓦拉赫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"切利尼娜的出現，給喬萬娜帶去了多少影響。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敘拉古人人都尊敬薩爾瓦多雷，但尊敬不意味著盲從。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩爾瓦多雷的時代在七年前落幕了，時至今日，你們難道真的心甘情願地陪著喬萬娜，守著他留下的遺產？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們本可以飛得更高，更遠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......首領是個顧全大局的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她顧全的大局，真的是你想要的大局嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅塞蒂家族曾在哥倫比亞叱吒風雲，與德克薩斯平起平坐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如今，回到敘拉古後，卻處處被其餘的十一個家族壓了一頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你心中的羅塞蒂，豈不是應該凌駕於其他家族之上，將西西里夫人從灰廳之中也拉下來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別說得好像你很瞭解我一樣，老東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不瞭解你，但我瞭解你這樣的人，瞭解你的眼神。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有一個還有活力的人，會適應敘拉古這潭死水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當你看到切利尼娜活著走出那間房間時，你還不明白嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......就算是這樣，老東西，就算你說得沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這也是我們家族自己的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們這些老派的家族，不是最不齒做這些不講道義的事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼，敘拉古人的尊嚴，說到底也不過如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你又錯了，瓦拉赫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我邀請你來，是想向你分享一個機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個推翻敘拉古現有的秩序，建立新的秩序的機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼是羅塞蒂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"六十年前，西西里夫人從拉特蘭帶回了“銃與秩序”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如今，許多人只記得灰廳的創建是十二家族坐在一起共同決定的結果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卻忘了，西西里夫人是用什麼讓十二家族坐在一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是絕對的實力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿爾貝托太過喜歡審時度勢，他謹慎了一輩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而要面對西西里夫人，我不需要一個謹慎的盟友，我想要的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是同樣想要推翻現有秩序的朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好好想想，瓦拉赫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝納爾多","speakerId":"avg_npc_685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，是最好的機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首領現在在嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅塞蒂家族成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在房間裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去告訴首領，我打算綁架切利尼娜的那幾個朋友來對付切利尼娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅塞蒂家族成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我們，真的要這麼做嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你應該問的是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅塞蒂，真的要這樣下去嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g3_srccourt"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你確定，我們昨天遇到的，真的是那麼了不起的人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我猜應該是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可這麼厲害的人，真的會在這座城市嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我倒是覺得很正常哦，如果是我，我也會這麼做！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......被你這麼一說，忽然覺得非常有說服力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你怎麼知道他就在法院裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......啊，找到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為，他最後說的話，不就是說，他平時不在教堂，而是在法院嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對吧，老人家？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老人家？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Zzz......Zzzz......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是不是......不該打擾他？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，是你們兩個孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是有一些問題來請教您的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，好，好，坐吧，我向來是不討厭和年輕人聊天的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們有一個朋友，她似乎和某個家族有約定，必須幫助對方做事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們想知道，有沒有什麼辦法，能讓她從中脫身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們這個朋友，姓德克薩斯，是嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽說，貝納爾多是一個守信的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作為一個家族的領袖，想必不會言而無信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，就算是我們都看得出來，這座城市裡發生的事，是貝洛內家族對西西里夫人的挑釁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們......沒有辦法去干涉很複雜的事，說實話，我也不在乎這些......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，我們至少想避免德克薩斯成為西西里夫人的報復對象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當年，西西里對薩爾瓦多雷有多欣賞，就對朱塞佩的行為有多憤怒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為這是對她定下的秩序最為直接的挑釁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"西西里接受一切秩序內的挑戰，但她不容許有人破壞秩序。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以您想告訴我們......秩序意味著沒有網開一面，是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我曾經這麼想過，孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是人為建立的秩序，是沒有絕對可言的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就好像，我會見你們這一面，與切利尼娜沒有任何關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是因為恰好在這裡遇到了一個同族。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在西西里之前，敘拉古這片土地上，並非沒有秩序。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，家族們所信奉的秩序都來源於自身，家族之間的秩序各不相同，於是，他們之間只能鬥爭不斷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"西西里做的事情，並不是徹底打破這種秩序。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而是將不同家族之間的秩序統一為了一個標準。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有家族，成了同一個家族。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"於是，敘拉古成了敘拉古。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道，這意味著什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這意味著......敘拉古，實際上在西西里夫人前後......並沒有變化？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聰明。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敘拉古過去存在的問題，如今依然存在，我，我們，一清二楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但所有問題，只要來到西西里面前，都可以解決。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"見到西西里夫人......這也太難了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"關於這一點，我不會幫助你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，對她來說，或許有一個辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿格尼爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，這代價或許會有些大。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g7_reception"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅塞蒂家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首領？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅塞蒂家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您從昨晚開始，就一直在看著手裡的這串項鍊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是西西里夫人給我的信物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作為對我為德克薩斯收拾殘局，以及帶領哥倫比亞家族回歸敘拉古的回報。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅塞蒂家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，是這麼貴重的東西嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅塞蒂家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是打算在現在的局勢下用它嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我也在猶豫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你剛才說，瓦拉赫打算對切利尼娜的朋友下手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅塞蒂家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，現在那幾個人似乎出門了，等她們回來，埋伏的人就會出手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅塞蒂家族成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_697_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首領，您要去哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"買點巧克力。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g2_srcalley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖嘖，你果然沒猜錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅塞蒂的人，已經開始滲透這個街區了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等到企鵝物流的幾個人回來，恐怕會死得很慘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，我有一個問題，拉普蘭德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說說看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我也能猜到，羅塞蒂會對德克薩斯動手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你畢竟是薩盧佐的人，你真的有必要派甘比諾去跟著那個薩科塔，還要自己在這裡幫她們看家嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我從來都不知道，你居然是為了友情能夠付出這麼多的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我像那種人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我在好奇，你到底在等什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你開著那輛卡車撞了法庭，自己認罪，透過這些行為洗清了她的嫌疑，還把薩盧佐和貝洛內強行綁在了一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使我不知道為什麼兩家沒有打起來還開始了合作，但你肯定知道理由，你清楚這樣是在幫貝洛內，也就是幫助她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，在昨天的刺殺裡你也幫了她一把。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說，你要向她證明，敘拉古是一座泥潭，誰也逃不出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可在我看來，你只是在幫助她脫離這座泥潭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果說，需要我殺幾個她重視的人，需要我做一些讓她不快的事才能證明這一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就意味著，這只是我的偏執，而不是一個事實。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所謂事實的含義就是，即使我只是看著，一切也會那樣發生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但即使這樣也還不夠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我必須在不去阻礙她的同時，還要給她足夠的幫助，才能在最後讓她心甘情願地承認——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她的掙扎是多麼徒勞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這樣做你會得到滿足嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道，我只知道，除此之外，別無他法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在告訴我，你也不知道怎麼做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，我從不否認這一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你，卡彭，你應該學甘比諾認清一個事實，從我身上，找不到關於你們的答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你已經知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他想要透過成為貝洛內的一員來東山再起，而你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你依然站在這裡，你真的把自己當成了我的附庸嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是說，你期望著我的道路是一條能夠容下你的道路？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別抱這種期望，我會殺了你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的道路只容得下我一人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德克薩斯呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德克薩斯，或許是這條道路本身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。"},{"type":"narration","text":"卡彭沉默了一會，終於還是轉身離開。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈，意外之喜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_u"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然沒有來過......但看來我沒走錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡就是那個企鵝物流的小小據點了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"卡特琳娜小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"空......啊，對了，我給過你號碼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我是不是應該稱呼你為喬萬娜小姐更合適？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......還是叫我卡特琳娜吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我挺喜歡這個名字的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"敘拉古家族的人都喜歡在劇院裡給自己找份工作嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟並不是所有的時間，我們都在打打殺殺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們現在在一起嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g2_srcalley"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_u"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"卡特琳娜小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"空，能不能和我說一說，你們企鵝物流的事情？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比如說，企鵝物流是怎麼建立的，切利尼娜又是怎麼加入的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我也不是很清楚欸，畢竟在我被德克薩斯救下時，企鵝物流已經存在啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"聽老闆有幾次提到的，企鵝物流是他在遇到德克薩斯後，兩個人商量著建立的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不過，在我加入後發生的事情，那我能說的可就太多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟，我們在一起生活了好幾年呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，有機會，真想跟你們多聊聊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有許多切利尼娜的事情可以告訴你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也想從你那裡知道更多切利尼娜在龍門的生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果你有機會來龍門的話，我們一定帶你走遍龍門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不介意我的身份？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我只知道，你是德克薩斯過去最好的朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......能在龍門遇到你這麼善良的夥伴，切利尼娜真是個幸運的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我才覺得，在敘拉古有一個你這樣為她著想的朋友，她真幸運。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g2_srcalley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，空。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......就在剛才，我忽然有了一些靈感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我總是在思考一個盛大的落幕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想，在我的故事裡，她應當像一個敘拉古人一樣迎來自己的落幕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在一個小巷子裡被包圍，或者被汽車炸彈吞沒，等等等等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些來自現實的橋段，因為過於濫用，反而成了某種刻板印象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想避免這樣的印象，讓她成為這個故事中，最不像敘拉古人的敘拉古人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我試圖去尋找一個“敘拉古人”的形象，而我無法對此下定義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我一直以來無法動筆的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但現在，我有些明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有什麼敘拉古人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"切利尼娜·德克薩斯最後消失在了那場大火之中，沒有人知道她的下落。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......卡特琳娜小姐，你難道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"晚點回來，我給你們留了些禮物。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瓦拉赫，如果我沒記錯的話，你是想要綁架切利尼娜的朋友吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她們還沒有回來，就這麼興師動眾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果你不來，那我就會這麼做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很失望，首領，不，喬萬娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就這麼不願意等嗎，瓦拉赫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是願不願意等的問題，而是，我們為什麼要等？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼我們要心甘情願地等待著一個老古董的恩賜？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們跟著你來到這個國家，是等待著有朝一日成為這片土地的主人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而現在，就是機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的看清了嗎，你真的那麼確信自己勝券在握了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有那麼確定，我也沒有那麼自信能對付得了那些老古董......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我看得出來，貝洛內真的想要開創一個新的時代。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想賭一把大的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有多少人願意跟你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"七成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剩下的呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會慢慢說服他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者，由你來說服他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喬萬娜，如果你願意回心轉意，你依然是我們的首領。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......看來，我還是帶出了好手下的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜，瓦拉赫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德克薩斯，對你來說，難道比羅塞蒂還要重要？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬萬娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是，不覺得事情應該像這樣發生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我看來，有些事情，只能像這樣發生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_101_sora","aliases":["空"]}]}
